 
~ start

if GameState.hide_chase_active
	The cup won't help you right now.
	=> END

else
	PLUM: A cup of water. (Happy)

	- Take the cup of water
		The cup of water was added to your items.
		VINCENT: Nope! (Angry)
		Vincent removed the cup of water from your items.
		PLUM: Hey! (angry)
		VINCENT: I don't want you drinking anything old from here.
		PLUM: I wasn't going to drink it. (embarassed)
		=> END

	- Leave the cup of water
		=> END
 